      "prompt": "PRESS E TO LOOK",
      "dialog": "EVERY BOTTLE THE CITY MAKES, AND A FEW IT DOESN'T. THE DUCHESS SENT UP A CASE OF HALCYON '01 \"FOR THE NEW NEIGHBOUR.\""
    },
    {
      "x": 19,
      "y": 5,
      "type": "dialog",
      "label": "THE KITCHEN",
      "prompt": "PRESS E TO LOOK",
      "dialog": "A KITCHEN NOBODY HAS COOKED IN. THE OVEN KNOWS FOUR HUNDRED RECIPES AND YOUR NAME. THE LEMONS ARE REAL, WHICH IN ARCADIA IS A FLEX."
    },
    {
      "x": 9,
      "y": 2,
      "type": "dialog",
      "label": "THE GLASS",
      "prompt": "PRESS E TO LOOK",
      "dialog": "THE NEON ROYALE'S CROWN, LEVEL WITH YOUR WINDOW. FROM HERE THE WHALES LOOK LIKE ANYONE ELSE.",
      "action": "view",
