      "type": "dialog",
      "label": "LOUNGER",
      "prompt": "PRESS E TO LIE BACK",
      "dialog": "A DRINK WITH AN UMBRELLA IN IT, MELTING. NOBODY WILL ASK YOU TO DO ANYTHING FOR HOURS.",
      "action": "sit",
      "seat": [
        28.3,
